BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manners 3 - Advanced (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T141500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T151000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T010005Z
UID:1792937700_Manners3-Advanced@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your dog’s training to the next level? In Adva
 nced Manners\, we build on your basic foundation to add distractions\, lea
 ve treats behind\, and introduce some tricks to keep it interesting! This 
 class is designed to take your dog’s behavior above and beyond to make s
 ure he can keep his brain in any situation. If you want to get into therap
 y work\, dog sports\, or just want your best friend to go out and about wi
 th you\, Advanced Manners is the place to be!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canine Conditioning (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T141500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T151000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T010005Z
UID:1792937700_CanineConditioning@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Canine Conditioning is a fun educational canine fitness class 
 designed to help dogs move with strength\, confidence\, and purpose.\nThro
 ugh safe\, low impact exercises\, dogs will improve their balance\, streng
 th\, flexibility\, coordination\, and body awareness while reducing their 
 risk of injury. Whether you have an athlete preparing for competition\, an
  adventure companion who loves hiking and exploring\, the daily running pa
 rtner\, or a senior dog who could benefit from gentle conditioning and imp
 rove mobility\, this class provides exercises that can be tailored to your
  dog’s individual needs.\nHandlers will also learn how to support their 
 dog’s long term health through proper warm ups and cool down routines\, 
 safe exercises\, and an understanding of how fitness contributes to overal
 l performance\, recovery\, and everyday wellness.\nCanine Conditioning is 
 about more than building stronger dogs-it’s about creating healthier mov
 ement for every stage of life.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Agility - Competition Level 1 (Beth Martin)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T151500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T161500Z
