BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Puppy Kindergarten (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T164500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T174500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T010005Z
UID:1792946700_PuppyKindergarten@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:If you recently added a new puppy to your family\, you're in t
 he right place! Puppy Kindergarten is the perfect place to start for puppi
 es between the age of 2 and 5 months. We'll cover everything from teaching
  your puppy his name to the manners he'll need to be a great member of you
 r household. We'll also address unwanted behaviors like chewing\, jumping\
 , and pulling on the leash. Last but not least\, we'll help you socialize 
 your puppy to strange noises\, objects\, and surfaces!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Orientation (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T183000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T010005Z
UID:1792951200_Orientation@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Orientation is a mini-class to cover requirements and check th
 at your dog will be a good fit for Basic Manners. Our manners classes typi
 cally fill 1-3 weeks before they start\, so you may want to register for c
 lass in advance!\nAfter reserving your spot\, you'll receive a confirmatio
 n email with instructions for orientation. Please be sure you're opted in 
 for reminder emails and we look forward to seeing you soon!
END:VEVENT
