BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Specialty - Nice Greets with a Loose Leash (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261111T010500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261111T020000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261025T010024Z
UID:1794359100_Specialty-NiceGreetswithaLooseLeash@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Having a friendly dog is a wonderful thing! Having a friendly 
 dog with manners is even better. This 4 week class will focus on two essen
 tial skills: loose leash walking and keeping all four paws on the floor! T
 his class will teach your overly friendly dog how to appropriately greet (
 or ignore) people instead of tackling them with excitement. We’ll also h
 elp you teach your dog how to maintain that beautiful loose leash in the f
 ace of distractions (including other dogs) with the added bonus of getting
  better on leash attention from your dog.\nPlease note that this class is 
 for dogs who are extremely excited about saying hi to people and are leash
  pullers. This is not for dogs who respond fearfully or who lunge or bark 
 aggressively towards other people or dogs. If this is your first class at 
 Lucky Dog\, please attend an orientation before enrolling.
END:VEVENT
